# The compiler CI installs, pinned the way every other artifact this project
# downloads is pinned (docs/reference/artifacts.md): a version, a target, and
# the SHA-256 that ziglang.org publishes for that tarball.
#
# The version must match `minimum_zig_version` in build.zig.zon and the tested
# compiler in docs/development.md § Toolchain — `.github/install-zig.sh`
# checks the manifest and refuses to install anything else, so the three
# cannot drift. A Zig upgrade edits all of them in one unit of work.
#
# Digests come from https://ziglang.org/download/index.json; add a line to
